{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_028_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:382f77f4d2dc3b750420f3c6fe0cb6c7066418e521b57c71d0c5ee71efce95ed",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c70c693d96c58ee88bb35fe696cb23dbb719711b60644ac9be08d4a6275bb8e",
      "text": "那时梦想开始奔跑",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aea77a6ac32ac34796dc54bd4f3437ed1a794e4779f98137a5b78062a97e037e",
      "text": "为了研究甜点，庄一郎和制作人前往百货商店举办的\n甜点展销会。\n制作人在展销会场体会到了庄一郎对于甜点\n以及偶像所怀抱的想法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c70c693d96c58ee88bb35fe696cb23dbb719711b60644ac9be08d4a6275bb8e",
      "text": "那时梦想开始奔跑",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8bd88ee7aacddf4846fcad90a8284274b45574d01ac0486b3afee508c382d20",
      "text": "真不错呢，百货商店的甜点展销会啊。\n您打算在接下来的休息日去吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa5af1101a9c3fdc6fe3a3b3ce387999d52eb4163d6707a39a95fdfb79ab9dc7",
      "text": "是的。我所尊敬的一位糕点师会出摊参展。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f44fb40cf8a41525babd6ae76b35c792d32c02789aada8a84b1247cb7e671c2",
      "text": "他是一位能够构思出极具独创性甜点的大师，\n据说这次展销会上还会推出活动限定商品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4ac517c7717d9516fcd0fca03177fa45f6b10398bd213dc8d9caf00b6af42a4",
      "text": "除此之外还会销售各种各样的甜点，\n为了调研，我打算大干一场把它们都买齐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bcd553881ac9a91c90c6cb433c78b0c460672b2075c7b759e58a0b3e6872e62",
      "text": "光是听您说，连我都跟着心潮澎湃起来了。\n能买到心仪的商品就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:515664cef365de59c02f79e9494cb632941b3581a5a8c0f05ddcf6201c5dfba3",
      "text": "所以，如果不介意的话……\n●●●●プロデューサー也愿意一起去吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edd98631ecb67aca0421e294778ac8fe481f160ffe0c42e13b0b864aa7683537",
      "text": "我一个人没办法把所有的甜点都调研过来，\n所以想利用一下刚好留在事务所的你……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dfe9f67a94436dc8bb134c179d8edd04e531b1065cfd66a035bf7ef74f80556",
      "text": "嗯哼。不，比起一个人，两个人去的话\n一定会更开心，我是这么想的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89f4318a03c29a25c6f2824f8fca843489328b8e8b87f5ee9b212f1cbcc98d7d",
      "text": "可以吗？\n不嫌弃的话请务必让我同行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c785951b9dd32b712c7ae6b40127a6c7f755ba3393048481069d5d40b7a6f603",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n那么，我们来定一下碰头的时间吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
